WEBVTT

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:11.750
Ayaka!

00:00:13.620 --> 00:00:15.120
You okay?

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:26.200
Seiya Shinjuku, you're out.

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:28.700
Shit!

00:00:31.450 --> 00:00:33.330
Stop actin' all cocky, Fatass!

00:00:35.170 --> 00:00:41.200
Loser
Camp

00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:38.790
Man, even when I tell you
I'll let you go free if you escape,

00:00:38.790 --> 00:00:41.200
you're not much of a fight at all!

00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:44.450
C'mon, entertain your Master!

00:00:44.830 --> 00:00:47.040
You piece of shit slaves!

00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:57.450
Itsuwari mo naku waraeru you na kokoro ga hoshii

00:01:02.950 --> 00:01:09.160
Hajime kara nani mo nozomanakerya

00:01:10.450 --> 00:01:16.870
Kono kokoro shizumu koto nai no kana

00:01:17.620 --> 00:01:25.750
Aisareru yorokobi nara shitteiru kedo

00:01:25.750 --> 00:01:34.330
Monotarinai mitasarenai nayami wa tsukinai

00:01:36.290 --> 00:01:40.290
Karakara na kokoro uruoshite kureyo

00:01:40.290 --> 00:01:44.120
Afureru hodo yu wo sosoide kure

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:49.660
Munashiku tada hibiku kono sakebigoe

00:01:51.910 --> 00:01:55.870
Taikutsu de arifureteiru mainichi demo

00:01:55.870 --> 00:01:59.540
Kono mi ni ataerareta koufuku da to

00:01:59.540 --> 00:02:12.000
Itsuwari mo naku waraeru you na kokoro ga hoshii

00:02:29.160 --> 00:02:32.000
Yuuga sent me a phone number?

00:02:30.280 --> 00:02:32.550
Yuuga Ohta

00:02:38.620 --> 00:02:40.040
Hello?

00:02:40.040 --> 00:02:41.370
Who's this?

00:02:41.370 --> 00:02:43.830
What? You call me, then ask that?

00:02:44.950 --> 00:02:47.660
This is Shinnosuke Tachikawa.

00:02:49.620 --> 00:02:52.660
Never would've guessed it'd be you,
from all the way back then.

00:02:53.370 --> 00:02:56.120
Since then, I couldn't get in contact with Yuuga at all.

00:02:56.540 --> 00:02:57.870
Real pain in my ass.

00:02:59.160 --> 00:03:01.000
Yuuga's been enslaved.

00:03:01.250 --> 00:03:04.000
Enslaved? No way...

00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:06.790
I want to save him. Please help me.

00:03:07.790 --> 00:03:12.750
Christ, I told him this shit was bad news...

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:16.410
Dammit, I'll get you for this!

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:22.160
Okay, I'm takin' a cut as a reward for rescuin' you.

00:03:23.250 --> 00:03:25.000
You're good with that, right?

00:03:27.910 --> 00:03:29.330
You can have all of it.

00:03:29.330 --> 00:03:30.000
Huh?

00:03:31.080 --> 00:03:36.500
Forget that. You wanna make a bunch more
money by teaming up with me?

00:03:37.160 --> 00:03:39.410
Did you get hit too many times in the head?

00:03:39.870 --> 00:03:42.450
That was how I met Yuuga.

00:03:43.540 --> 00:03:48.330
I teamed up with Yuuga and saved up
to start a business with him.

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:53.620
But as soon as he got involved
with those SCMs, he started changing.

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:58.160
Instead of flipping the SCMs we bought for a profit,
he got obsessed with them,

00:03:58.790 --> 00:04:02.000
and eventually disappeared with
the million yen we'd saved up.

00:04:03.700 --> 00:04:06.200
Fine. I'll help you.

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:09.790
I've got some business with him, anyway.

00:04:10.750 --> 00:04:14.950
Where is Yuuga, though?
Can you find him on that map?

00:04:14.950 --> 00:04:19.500
We can't use the SCM map.
As of yesterday, it just won't load.

00:04:19.870 --> 00:04:21.450
Well then, how?

00:04:21.750 --> 00:04:24.500
I've got a helper feeding me information.

00:04:24.790 --> 00:04:27.660
He's texting his information to me.

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:30.750
Of course, it could all be a trap.

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:34.250
But I've got no other leads.

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:37.620
Even if you know where he is,
how're we gonna save him?

00:04:37.910 --> 00:04:40.120
And who are we up against, anyway?

00:04:40.120 --> 00:04:44.200
Tsubaki Setagaya made
Yuuga and the others his slaves.

00:04:44.870 --> 00:04:49.790
However, apparently another man
took all of Setagaya's slaves.

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:52.790
That man's name is Takio Minato.

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:55.910
Right now, he's in possession of eighteen slaves.

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:59.750
Eighteen? We going up against all of them?

00:04:59.750 --> 00:05:02.660
Obviously, we can't fight them all.

00:05:02.870 --> 00:05:06.500
We'll challenge their master to a fight,
then steal them all at once.

00:05:06.500 --> 00:05:07.620
But how?

00:05:07.620 --> 00:05:09.080
I'll figure it out.

00:05:10.290 --> 00:05:14.330
Seriously? What're we gonna do...

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:16.040
Hey.

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:23.950
Let me help, Eia Arakawa.

00:05:26.910 --> 00:05:28.700
Aren't you...

00:05:31.920 --> 00:05:33.950
DO NOT ENTER
Notice of Construction

00:05:41.950 --> 00:05:46.000
Christ, you guys aren't even good
at being targets.

00:05:54.370 --> 00:05:56.870
This is fuckin' easy mode, seriously.

00:05:58.540 --> 00:06:04.000
Oh yeah, Tsubaki-sensei,
how many SCMs are there in total?

00:06:04.830 --> 00:06:06.500
Twenty-three.

00:06:06.500 --> 00:06:09.040
Who're the ones I haven't enslaved?

00:06:09.040 --> 00:06:13.910
Eia Arakawa, Ryuuou Edogawa, and Gekkou Itabashi.

00:06:15.330 --> 00:06:20.120
Me and my slaves make nineteen,
and then there's those three...

00:06:20.120 --> 00:06:22.000
There's one missing.

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:27.330
A man named Shinnosuke Tachikawa
bought one and sold it, it seems.

00:06:28.500 --> 00:06:33.200
Well, whatever. I'll make those last three
my slaves soon enough.

00:06:35.450 --> 00:06:38.160
Okay, let's work up another sweat, Zero!

00:06:38.950 --> 00:06:42.450
Go pick a few girls from the locked room
and bring 'em out here!

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:45.750
I'm gonna make 'em serve me real good!

00:06:46.700 --> 00:06:48.620
Yes, Master.

00:06:49.500 --> 00:06:51.870
You wanna join in on the fun?

00:06:59.300 --> 00:07:00.300
No guards 3rd Floor

00:07:00.300 --> 00:07:00.800
Sending

00:07:00.800 --> 00:07:01.580
Sent

00:07:01.580 --> 00:07:04.700
Target isolated. Now's our chance.

00:07:04.700 --> 00:07:05.700
Okay.

00:07:05.700 --> 00:07:07.450
Good over here.

00:07:07.950 --> 00:07:11.540
The lookout's on the west. Use the eastern stairs.

00:07:15.950 --> 00:07:18.500
Let me help, Eia Arakawa.

00:07:18.870 --> 00:07:20.120
Aren't you...

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:21.500
Ryuuou.

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:24.750
There's someone I want to get back, too.

00:07:26.450 --> 00:07:29.580
Made it to the third floor. Visual on the target.

00:07:30.250 --> 00:07:33.620
Okay. Begin your mission!

00:07:36.450 --> 00:07:37.700
Bingo!

00:07:43.540 --> 00:07:47.830
You're finally back!
Now it's time for today's Service Time to...

00:07:47.830 --> 00:07:48.950
Don't move.

00:07:50.660 --> 00:07:51.950
Wha-

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:54.790
Shit... who's there?

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:57.160
Eia Arakawa.

00:07:57.160 --> 00:07:59.120
I challenge you to a duel.

00:08:10.910 --> 00:08:12.200
According to our information,

00:08:12.200 --> 00:08:17.250
Takio Minato is using the third-floor room
of this abandoned school as his base.

00:08:17.540 --> 00:08:20.950
He's using his slaves as guards throughout the school.

00:08:20.950 --> 00:08:24.750
We'll go around the guards and sneak into Takio's room.

00:08:25.160 --> 00:08:29.750
Our opponent may think the Judgement SCM
is his trump card,

00:08:29.750 --> 00:08:32.500
but since Eia has never lost to anyone,
it won't work on her.

00:08:33.250 --> 00:08:38.410
While Eia challenges Takio Minato to a duel,
Shinnosuke will set up the trap.

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:40.040
O-oh...

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:43.910
I will give you instructions from here.
Follow them closely.

00:08:44.160 --> 00:08:46.870
Guys like this kind of thing, don't they?

00:08:46.870 --> 00:08:51.120
I mean, maybe, but actually doing it
is a completely different thing...

00:08:51.330 --> 00:08:54.830
The women appear to be locked up in this storehouse.

00:08:55.450 --> 00:08:57.620
Once Takio is enslaved, go there to rescue them.

00:08:58.200 --> 00:08:59.870
We do this tonight.

00:08:59.870 --> 00:09:01.330
The key to the duel...

00:09:01.750 --> 00:09:04.120
Is making it a duel between Takio and you.

00:09:04.410 --> 00:09:06.750
I challenge you to a duel.

00:09:09.870 --> 00:09:10.370
Hey!

00:09:14.040 --> 00:09:17.500
Unfortunately, I've got the Judgement SCM, and...

00:09:20.580 --> 00:09:22.500
Doesn't work on you, huh?

00:09:22.500 --> 00:09:26.160
The duel is, whoever begs for his life loses.

00:09:26.160 --> 00:09:28.040
Well? Do you accept?

00:09:36.830 --> 00:09:39.910
Jeez, you scared the shit out of me.

00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:41.950
What happened to guarding the place, huh?!

00:09:41.950 --> 00:09:44.410
They snuck in here like it was a piece of cake!

00:09:44.410 --> 00:09:46.000
I'm talkin' to you too, dammit!

00:09:46.700 --> 00:09:48.410
Don't sit there silent, staring at me!

00:09:48.410 --> 00:09:50.250
Useless fuckwits...

00:09:53.500 --> 00:09:59.200
Right, the duel was whoever begs for her life loses?

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:00.910
Alright, sounds interesting!

00:10:01.290 --> 00:10:03.410
I accept your challenge!

00:10:04.120 --> 00:10:07.750
I'm looking forward to hearing
just how you'll scream.

00:10:08.700 --> 00:10:13.120
Whenever women start getting uppity,
it's 'cause they've got someone helping them.

00:10:13.580 --> 00:10:15.120
Find the men helping her!

00:10:15.410 --> 00:10:18.500
After that, take care of this gross old man!

00:10:18.950 --> 00:10:22.750
He's sure got guts to go after you himself.

00:10:22.750 --> 00:10:24.830
All is according to plan on our side.
How are things over there?

00:10:24.830 --> 00:10:26.450
I'm doing everything you told me to!

00:10:26.660 --> 00:10:27.830
This is the last one!

00:10:27.830 --> 00:10:30.080
Oh, guards are heading your way.

00:10:30.080 --> 00:10:31.450
Be careful not to be spotted.

00:10:31.450 --> 00:10:33.700
Hey, don't spring that on me!
Three, two, one.

00:10:35.200 --> 00:10:42.080
That fuckin' prick, I'm gonna punch him
right in the glasses someday! You with me?

00:10:42.080 --> 00:10:43.290
Yeah...

00:10:43.290 --> 00:10:45.870
You're so annoying,
why don't you put glasses on, old fart?

00:10:45.870 --> 00:10:47.370
Then I'll punch you.

00:10:47.370 --> 00:10:49.000
What?! No, I'm good!

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:52.450
It won't hurt.

00:10:52.450 --> 00:10:54.250
It'll definitely hurt!

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:55.660
I'll check over here.

00:10:55.660 --> 00:10:57.500
Huh? Okay.

00:10:57.500 --> 00:11:00.950
C'mon, Old Man, leave it to me
and just go off to look on your own.

00:11:00.950 --> 00:11:02.450
But...

00:11:05.750 --> 00:11:07.040
Yo.

00:11:07.040 --> 00:11:09.700
You weren't hiding very well.

00:11:13.950 --> 00:11:18.450
Okay... how am I gonna get you to beg for your life?

00:11:18.700 --> 00:11:20.870
Well, first, have a drink with me.

00:11:26.450 --> 00:11:28.750
Hey! He found me!

00:11:28.870 --> 00:11:30.250
Do something on your own.

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:31.750
Dammit!

00:11:32.250 --> 00:11:33.250
It's starting.

00:11:42.040 --> 00:11:43.660
What the hell is going on?!

00:11:43.660 --> 00:11:46.000
I dunno! Everything just burst into flames!

00:11:46.000 --> 00:11:46.910
What?!

00:11:48.160 --> 00:11:50.160
There was an explosion on the stairs
on the second floor, too!

00:11:50.830 --> 00:11:52.080
And on the east side, too!

00:11:52.080 --> 00:11:53.580
Everyone, go down to the first floor!

00:11:53.580 --> 00:11:55.330
Why're you giving orders?!

00:11:55.330 --> 00:11:56.330
Get back here!

00:11:56.330 --> 00:11:58.830
We can't go upstairs anymore, it's impossible!

00:11:58.830 --> 00:12:01.330
I don't care, go through the fire if you have to!

00:12:01.330 --> 00:12:03.160
Hey! Are you listening to me?!

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:04.580
Don't you run from me!

00:12:04.750 --> 00:12:07.450
God, you're all so fucking useless!

00:12:14.250 --> 00:12:15.750
This is crazy.

00:12:16.080 --> 00:12:17.950
Are we gonna be okay?

00:12:21.160 --> 00:12:23.160
Give it up, Yuuga.

00:12:23.160 --> 00:12:27.370
I'm sorry, but he ordered me to catch the intruders.

00:12:28.750 --> 00:12:30.910
Nothing I can do, then... I'll go at it with you.

00:12:31.330 --> 00:12:35.660
I was thinking about smacking you
in the face, after all!

00:12:37.500 --> 00:12:38.540
Fuck!

00:12:41.500 --> 00:12:43.450
Why won't they obey my orders?!

00:12:43.450 --> 00:12:45.750
They're all looking down on me!

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:49.870
You can't order slaves to endanger their lives.

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:52.410
That's one of the basic rules of SCMs, isn't it?

00:12:55.370 --> 00:12:56.120
Fuck!

00:13:09.750 --> 00:13:11.410
Surrender already!

00:13:11.410 --> 00:13:15.080
No way! The thought of losing to you ticks me off!

00:13:15.080 --> 00:13:15.790
The fuck?!

00:13:18.330 --> 00:13:23.540
Still, I never figured you'd come to rescue me.

00:13:24.330 --> 00:13:26.870
Yuuga, I...

00:13:27.620 --> 00:13:28.910
Hey, did ya find them?

00:13:29.040 --> 00:13:32.040
Don't let them get away! Not after they fucked with us...

00:13:32.200 --> 00:13:33.750
We're gonna fuckin' kill you!

00:13:33.870 --> 00:13:35.910
We're in a real bad situation this time...

00:13:36.040 --> 00:13:38.410
Yuuga, forget about me, just get out of here!

00:13:38.540 --> 00:13:40.040
Okay, got it!

00:13:40.160 --> 00:13:41.290
Wait, really?

00:13:41.410 --> 00:13:44.790
You idiot, like hell I'd do something like that!

00:13:45.250 --> 00:13:47.250
Bros don't leave each other behind.

00:13:47.370 --> 00:13:49.290
C'mon, let's get outta here!

00:13:53.410 --> 00:13:57.250
Yuuga, I love you!

00:13:57.250 --> 00:13:58.250
What?!

00:14:10.540 --> 00:14:13.910
Never thought you'd try to catch me off guard
with a lie like that...

00:14:13.910 --> 00:14:16.290
I wasn't lying, though.

00:14:16.290 --> 00:14:18.830
I love you 'cause you're my bro.

00:14:19.200 --> 00:14:20.950
But you're paying me back.

00:14:21.200 --> 00:14:22.500
You clean things up?

00:14:22.500 --> 00:14:23.750
Huh? Yeah.

00:14:23.750 --> 00:14:26.120
Right then, head to the third floor.

00:14:26.250 --> 00:14:27.870
The flames are rising fast.

00:14:27.870 --> 00:14:30.040
Shinnosuke, I believe you might've used too much fuel.

00:14:30.040 --> 00:14:33.450
What? No... well, maybe.

00:14:33.450 --> 00:14:34.160
Hurry.

00:14:34.160 --> 00:14:35.000
Got it.

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:35.870
Wait...

00:14:36.080 --> 00:14:39.330
The women are locked up in the basement.

00:14:40.120 --> 00:14:42.580
What? I thought they were in the storage room outside.

00:14:42.790 --> 00:14:45.040
He moved them in here today.

00:14:45.700 --> 00:14:48.160
Yo, things are not looking good at this rate.

00:14:48.830 --> 00:14:51.450
Shinnosuke, go to Eia. Hurry.

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:52.700
Got it.

00:15:04.870 --> 00:15:06.290
Fuck...

00:15:06.540 --> 00:15:08.450
Start begging for your life already!

00:15:08.450 --> 00:15:10.330
Do you wanna die or something?! Fuck!

00:15:10.330 --> 00:15:12.160
I'm not doing either!

00:15:12.160 --> 00:15:15.080
How the hell are you gonna beat me like this?!

00:15:15.290 --> 00:15:17.330
Do you want slaves that badly?!

00:15:19.040 --> 00:15:19.790
Just the opposite.

00:15:20.040 --> 00:15:22.830
I want to free everyone from slavery.

00:15:22.830 --> 00:15:23.790
What?!

00:15:24.160 --> 00:15:26.410
At first, I was curious.

00:15:27.000 --> 00:15:29.790
It wasn't like there was someone I wanted to be,

00:15:29.790 --> 00:15:32.250
or something I wanted to devote myself to.

00:15:32.410 --> 00:15:37.330
I thought the SCM might be able to give me something.

00:15:37.330 --> 00:15:40.330
But I was wrong.

00:15:40.620 --> 00:15:45.330
The SCM is an evil device that ruins
the lives of all who touch it.

00:15:45.910 --> 00:15:48.830
That's why it shouldn't exist at all.

00:15:49.160 --> 00:15:53.120
I'm going to save you, too, from the SCM's curse.

00:15:53.580 --> 00:15:55.950
Stop looking down on me!

00:15:56.250 --> 00:15:57.200
You piece of shit!

00:15:59.080 --> 00:16:00.830
Like hell I'll let you!

00:16:01.120 --> 00:16:02.700
I don't need you to save me!

00:16:02.700 --> 00:16:04.500
You're gonna die in this fire!

00:16:06.580 --> 00:16:09.330
Hey, Zero, watch her!

00:16:09.620 --> 00:16:10.950
I'm gonna...

00:16:13.950 --> 00:16:17.160
Hey, what're you doing, Zero?!

00:16:18.040 --> 00:16:19.950
I'm not Zero.

00:16:21.660 --> 00:16:27.040
There's no one left who will follow your orders.

00:16:27.790 --> 00:16:30.370
Let's continue in our duel.

00:16:30.370 --> 00:16:31.660
Or do you forfeit?

00:16:31.660 --> 00:16:33.910
I don't give a shit about that!

00:16:39.910 --> 00:16:43.290
Hey, where do you think you're going?

00:16:46.830 --> 00:16:48.580
We can't go downstairs anymore.

00:16:50.000 --> 00:16:51.950
How're we getting out of here?

00:16:52.410 --> 00:16:54.500
I don't know. I didn't think about that.

00:16:54.500 --> 00:16:56.620
What?! You shitting me?!

00:16:56.620 --> 00:17:01.040
Crap, that means this is our last option...

00:17:02.410 --> 00:17:04.000
Hey, wai...

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:04.870
Here we go!

00:17:04.870 --> 00:17:05.660
Right!

00:17:05.660 --> 00:17:06.950
Fuck! Wait! Stop!

00:17:16.870 --> 00:17:19.040
Somebody help me!

00:17:28.410 --> 00:17:33.120
My goodness. You sure are a reckless lot, aren't you?

00:17:38.500 --> 00:17:40.250
Tell me about it.

00:17:54.250 --> 00:17:55.160
Julia!

00:17:56.290 --> 00:17:57.290
Master Ryuuou!

00:18:10.910 --> 00:18:13.540
Ryuuou! Leave it to me!

00:18:13.540 --> 00:18:15.950
Let the adults help you in times like these!

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:22.660
Julia!

00:18:22.660 --> 00:18:24.040
Get outside, quickly!

00:18:30.200 --> 00:18:32.700
You sure took some drastic measures there...

00:18:32.830 --> 00:18:34.700
Maybe I overdid it a little.

00:18:34.700 --> 00:18:36.700
"Overdid it" doesn't explain the half of it!

00:18:36.700 --> 00:18:38.250
Kiyo-senpai...

00:18:38.250 --> 00:18:39.950
Oh, Maria...

00:18:39.950 --> 00:18:41.790
I'm sorry, I...

00:18:42.200 --> 00:18:43.750
It's okay, it's okay,

00:18:43.750 --> 00:18:47.700
just don't tell Zero about this one cigarette.

00:18:48.040 --> 00:18:49.500
Senpai...

00:18:50.830 --> 00:18:52.700
Lady Maria!

00:18:53.750 --> 00:18:55.620
Gekkou?! Why are you...

00:18:57.330 --> 00:19:00.700
I followed the faint noise of the SCMs to join you here!

00:19:00.700 --> 00:19:04.120
Now I, Gekkou, will slay the enemies attacking you!

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:06.000
It's already over.

00:19:06.000 --> 00:19:06.870
No...

00:19:07.330 --> 00:19:12.160
In the end, Eia's the one who won the SCM game.

00:19:13.250 --> 00:19:16.870
Once she frees everyone, it's over.

00:19:16.870 --> 00:19:20.200
Hold on. I still haven't lost yet.

00:19:20.200 --> 00:19:22.410
Huh? Wait, after all that...

00:19:22.410 --> 00:19:25.700
It's okay. Let's have one last duel.

00:19:26.500 --> 00:19:27.950
Okay.

00:19:30.620 --> 00:19:31.950
Here we go.

00:19:47.830 --> 00:19:49.620
Huh?

00:19:51.830 --> 00:19:53.950
This is an order from your master.

00:19:54.660 --> 00:19:57.450
There will be no more duels to make others into slaves.

00:19:58.160 --> 00:20:01.910
I release all of you from slavery!

00:20:06.580 --> 00:20:08.950
Now we're all free, huh?

00:20:10.160 --> 00:20:11.120
Uh, no.

00:20:11.870 --> 00:20:13.080
Gimme my money back, 'kay?

00:20:13.080 --> 00:20:14.370
Yeah, I will.

00:20:14.370 --> 00:20:17.200
I will, but it kinda got burned up...

00:20:17.200 --> 00:20:18.410
What?

00:20:18.410 --> 00:20:19.870
Ryuuou... kun.

00:20:23.580 --> 00:20:26.120
Thank you for saving me.

00:20:27.580 --> 00:20:29.910
Next time, we'll save your mother.

00:20:29.910 --> 00:20:32.830
I'll do everything I can to help you.

00:20:36.450 --> 00:20:37.450
Julia.

00:20:37.450 --> 00:20:38.160
Hm?

00:20:38.750 --> 00:20:43.830
Sorry. And... thank you.

00:20:45.120 --> 00:20:46.330
Sure.

00:20:50.290 --> 00:20:53.040
I'll wash my hands of your mother.

00:20:53.830 --> 00:20:55.830
I do pride myself for being a businessman.

00:20:55.950 --> 00:20:59.040
As such, I must repay you
the debt I owe you for saving my life.

00:20:59.200 --> 00:21:02.040
The rest is up to you and your mother.

00:21:05.540 --> 00:21:07.870
Boss, I tried to cover our tracks,

00:21:07.870 --> 00:21:10.330
but the local fire department's demanding to step in...

00:21:10.330 --> 00:21:12.410
Well, I'm not surprised...

00:21:12.660 --> 00:21:16.620
This fire is a bit too impressive to call it a movie shoot...

00:21:16.910 --> 00:21:21.540
Right then, how should I thank you for your help?

00:21:22.040 --> 00:21:25.040
Where's Tsubaki Setagaya?
I don't see him anywhere around...

00:21:25.040 --> 00:21:28.660
I'm sorry, sir, he disappeared
when we weren't looking...

00:21:28.660 --> 00:21:31.500
Find him and bring him to me, no matter what.

00:21:31.500 --> 00:21:34.370
I've got to repay him for his kindness, too.

00:21:35.370 --> 00:21:37.290
I told you, it all got burned up...

00:21:37.290 --> 00:21:39.870
What? C'mon, you gotta have a better excuse.

00:21:39.870 --> 00:21:41.290
It's true, though!

00:21:48.290 --> 00:21:49.410
Eia!

00:21:51.040 --> 00:21:52.950
Let's go, Zushi.

00:22:06.200 --> 00:22:07.580
Bye bye.

00:22:22.450 --> 00:22:26.040
-explosion-

00:22:27.910 --> 00:22:32.660
Kyuukyoku no game kokoro o tamesareteru

00:22:32.660 --> 00:22:37.500
Ichi tai ichi kara hajimaru kakehiki wa

00:22:37.500 --> 00:22:40.120
Girigiri ni miete osu ka hiku ka setogiwa no koubou

00:22:40.120 --> 00:22:41.910
Girigiri ni miete osu ka hiku ka setogiwa no koubou

00:22:41.910 --> 00:22:45.040
Nee dochira ga yuusei

00:22:45.040 --> 00:22:49.290
Kachime no nai rule demo ii

00:22:49.290 --> 00:22:55.500
Te no hira ni wa saki no mienai one chance

00:22:55.500 --> 00:23:00.660
Me no mae no deck wa mirai terashiteru?

00:23:01.330 --> 00:23:10.250
Omote to ura no kaoiro ukagau fuserareta unmei

00:23:10.250 --> 00:23:15.450
Un o hikiyosete make nante mitakunai

00:23:15.450 --> 00:23:19.200
Nainai bakari ja shinka dekinai

00:23:19.200 --> 00:23:23.790
Kimi no kake ni uchikatte

00:23:23.910 --> 00:23:31.620
Kabe o koeteyuke nido to bust shinai tame ni
